recommend keep-going -- the partially-filled S(n,k) is the next measurable moonshot and needs no gate: a supervision tree of 800 members on an 840-vertex shape has 40 holes, and whether the chain rule can walk past a hole without a table of live members is the one falsifier a real deployment meets first.
